('Exact finite point-source configurations at n=256,1024,4096,16384 and wired-square identities at L=9,18,36,72 were computed and validated.','numerical_evidence','ATTEMPT.md section 10; experiments.jsonl','Finitely many computations establish neither convergence nor a counterexample at infinity.',['Mass conservation; no boundary topplings; identity idempotence and burning-once; independent parallel schedule checks'])
